# Cursor Rules Index

Thin adapter index for Cursor. `.ai/` is the source of truth.

## Start here

- `.ai/README.md` — canonical AI instruction entrypoint
- `.ai/instructions/workflow.md` — operational workflow rules

## Cursor rules in this folder

These files are thin pointers to canonical documents in `.ai/`. They do not
define workflow, quality, review, or Git rules locally.

| Rule | Canonical reference |
|---|---|
| `use-ai-folder.mdc` | `.ai/README.md` |
| `documentation-first.mdc` | `.ai/conventions/documentation-rules.md` |
| `small-steps.mdc` | `.ai/policies/no-blind-coding.md` |
| `ai-workflow.mdc` | `.ai/instructions/workflow.md` |
| `review-and-quality.mdc` | `.ai/review/README.md`, `.ai/quality/` |

Do not duplicate `.ai/` workflow content in Cursor rules. Point to it.
